    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "skit",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Now I haven't eaten all day",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "How am I gonna do this, man?",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Yeah, don't wait for her, man, don't wait for her",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I'll tell you what, man: come with me now and you know",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I'll get you some lunch, I'll hook you up with something (MM.. FOOD)",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I got a little bank, y'know, no problem",
          "rhyme": "Em",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I hear you, that's cool (Alright? It's cool)",
          "rhyme": "ul",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Man, can't you guys just wait here about a half hour, man?",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Yo, I'll be back man, I'm just gonna munch up a little bit, man, I'm pretty hungry",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Yo, let him come back",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEFGBHI",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDEAFBEG"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "skit",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Here you will find food for your body",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "As well as comfort for your troubled mind",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I'd really like some soup (Bread and butter?)",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Of course my friend",
          "rhyme": ")d",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "What happened to your hand?",
          "rhyme": "#d",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Ah, nothing",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Oh, food at last!",
          "rhyme": "ast",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEFG",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDBAE"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "skit",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "How did they get here?",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Regular storage procedure, the same as the other food",
          "rhyme": "ud",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "What other food?",
          "rhyme": "ud",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Fish (Food)",
          "rhyme": "iS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Protein, grass (For you)",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABBCD",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABBCD"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "skit",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Now what happened?",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Well, the cop got",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "The next morning I went to the store to get some food",
          "rhyme": "ud",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "(Bread and butter) They arrested me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I'll save you (Thank you)",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Would you like a snack?",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Thanks for the drink",
          "rhyme": ")k",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Chicken, beef or turkey",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEFGH",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDCEFA"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_5",
      "type": "skit",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Operation: Doomsday complete",
          "rhyme": "Et",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "All your intercoms casualty and damage tested",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AB",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AB"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_6",
      "type": "skit",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Enough! You talk of the people's rights",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "The people have only those rights which I choose to give them",
          "rhyme": "Em",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And that's for their own good, believe me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I do, DOOM",
          "rhyme": "um",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "They disappoint me, they must work faster",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "But the prisoner",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Ah yes, the young traitor who has tried to turn my people against me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Watch him, I have special plans for that one",
          "rhyme": "On",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEFCG",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDEFCG"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_7",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Beef rap could lead to getting teeth capped",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Or even a wreath for Mom Dukes on some grief crap",
          "rhyme": "ap",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I suggest a change of diet",
          "rhyme": "Et",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "It can lead to high blood pressure if you fry it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Or even a stroke, heart attack, heart disease",
          "rhyme": "iz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "It ain't no starting back once arteries start to squeeze",
          "rhyme": "iz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Take the easy way out phony, until then",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "They know they wouldn't be talking that baloney in the bullpen",
          "rhyme": "@n",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "So disgusting, pardon self as I discuss this",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "They talk a wealth of shit and they ain't never seen the justice",
          "rhyme": "is",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Bust this, like a cold milk from out the toilet",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Two batteries, some Brillo and some foil, heat'll boil it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "He be better off on PC glued",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "And it's a feud so don't be in no TV mood",
          "rhyme": "ud",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Every week it's mystery meat, seaweed stewed",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "(Food, we need food!)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEEFGHIJDKLAM",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDDDCEDDCDCFAG"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_8",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "He wears a mask just to cover the raw flesh",
          "rhyme": "aS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "A rather ugly brother with flows that's gorgeous",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Drop dead joints hit the whips like bird shit",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "They need it like a hole in their head or a third tit",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Her bra smell, his card say, \"Aw Hell!\"",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Barred from all bars and kicked out the Carvel",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Keep a cooker where the jar fell",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "And keep a cheap hooker that's off the hook like Ma Bell",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Top bleeding, maybe fella took the loaded rod gears",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Stop feeding babies colored sugar-coated lard squares",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "The odd pair swears and God fears",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Even when it's rotten, we've gotten through the hard years",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "I wrote this note around New Year's",
          "rhyme": "ins",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Off a couple of shots and a few beers, but who cares?",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Enough about me, it's about the beats",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Not about the streets and who food he 'bout to eat (With but a—)",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "A rhyming cannibal who's dressed to kill and cynical",
          "rhyme": "al",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Whether is it animal, vegetable or mineral",
          "rhyme": "al",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "It's a miracle how he get so lyrical",
          "rhyme": "al",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "And proceed to move the crowd like an old negro spiritual",
          "rhyme": "Ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "For a mil', do a commercial for Mello Yello",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Tell them devils, \"Hell no, sell y'all own Jello\"",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "We hollow krills, she swallow pills",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "He follow flea collar three dollars bills",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "And squealed for halal veal, if y'all appeal",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Dig the real, it's how the big ballers deal",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "Twirl an L after every meal (Food!)",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEEEEFFFFGFHIJJJKLLMMMMM",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCCDDDDAAAACAAAAAAEFFCCCCC"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_9",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "What up? To all rappers: shut up with your shutting up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "And keep a shirt on, at least a button-up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Yuck, is they rhymers or strippin' males?",
          "rhyme": "al",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Out-of-work jerks since they shut down Chippendales",
          "rhyme": "Ejlz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "They chippin' nails, DOOM tippin' scales",
          "rhyme": "al",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Let alone the pre-orders that's counted off shippin' sales",
          "rhyme": "al",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "This one goes out to all my peoples skippin' bail",
          "rhyme": "aj",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Dippin' jail, whippin' tail and sippin' ale",
          "rhyme": "al",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Light the doobie 'til it glow like a ruby",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "After which, they couldn't find the Villain, like Scooby",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "He's in the lab on some old Buddha Monk shit",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Overproof drunk shit, but who'd'a thunk it?",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Punk, try and ask why ours be better",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Could be the iron mask or the Cosby sweater",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Yes, you, who's screwed by the dude on the CD, nude",
          "rhyme": "yd",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "(We need food!)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABCBBDBEEFFGHIJ",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABCBBBBDDDDEAFG"
    }
